# text = I have two children at home ill from their flour ; I have been very poorly myself ; one is used to a little white clay , but when they lay it on thick , it's very grave Are your girls in the pit No ; we strive to keep them out , and my man has gone scores of days on bread and water for that purpose ; and if we were not forced to take so much tommy , one might manage -- but tommy will beat anything ; Health first , and honesty afterwards , that's my say Well , for my part meat's my grievance : all the best bits go to the butties , and the pieces with bone in are chopped off for the colliers' wives Dame , when will the door open
