# text = And the other half Ah ! the other half Well , then -- we shall have a death in our family soon -- this poor babe can't struggle on much longer ; it belongs to two burial clubs - - that will be three pounds from each , and after the drink and the funeral , there will be enough to pay all our debts and put us all square I was first , Master Joseph No ; I was I was here as the clock struck four , and seated myself on the steps , because I must be home early ; my husband is hurt in the knee
