# text = Well , I am ready to save Gerard , my friend , for so I'll call him as you wish it ; one I have served before and long ; one whom I came up from Mowbray this day to serve and save ; I am ready to do that which you require ; you yourself admit it is no light deed ; and coming from one you have known so long , and , as you confess , so much regarded , should be doubly cherished ; I am ready to do this great service ; to save the father from death and the daughter from despair . -- if she would but only say to me , ' I have but one reward , and it is yours I have read of something of this sort this bargaining of blood , and shall I call it love ?
